 "pages": {
  "default/31547.htm": {
   "file": "default/31547.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Beolin: Hi there! Is this a great place or what? I was sick when I came here and now I feel great! Better than I've felt in my whole life, in fact! These springs are miraculous! Come on in! The water's wonderful!",
   "header": "Beolin",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Tell me more about the hot springs.\"",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 1",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/31547-1.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "Quest",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Quest",
     "kind": "quest-menu",
     "to": "@questlist"
    }
   ]
  },
  "default/31547-1.htm": {
   "file": "default/31547-1.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Beolin: Did you know that these hot springs are a very effective treatment for abnormal conditions? The red hot spring is good for cholera and malaria, the yellow for rheumatism and malaria, and the green for influenza and malaria. If you're in need of rejuvenation, take a dip in the hot springs!",
   "header": "Beolin",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Return",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 0",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/31547.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
